    <div id="block-waubonsee-content" class="block block-system block-system-main-block">
  
    
      

      <div class="field field--name-field-content field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
              <div class="field__item">

            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-wysiwyg-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>Waubonsee athletics has a rich history of contributing to the total ­development of our students and to the campus ­community. To ­celebrate this rich history, the Athletic Hall of Fame was ­established during the 2006-2007 ­academic year. Our ­inductees are ­student-athletes, coaches and community ­supporters who are defined by their ­involvement with, ­advancement of, and dedication to Waubonsee ­athletics; ­contributions to the ­surrounding ­community; and ­career ­accomplishments earned after ­leaving ­Waubonsee. These ­individuals ­represent the very best of collegiate athletics.</p></div>
      

</div>
              <div class="field__item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type-gold-cta-s paragraph--view-mode-default">
  
        <h2 >
        
                  Watch the 2023 Athletic Hall of Fame Induction Ceremony and Student-Athlete Recognition
      
  
    </h2>


            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-gcta-subheading field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>The college will host the induction ceremony on <strong>Thursday, May 18 at 6:30 p.m.</strong></p>
</div>
      
      <div class="field field--name-field-gcta-link field--type-link field--label-hidden field__items">
              <div class="field__item"><a href="https://gochiefs.com/HOF">Induction Ceremony 2023</a></div>
          </div>
  
</div>

</div>
              <div class="field__item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type-p-col-w-icon paragraph--view-mode-default">
  
  
      <div class="field field--name-field-col-w-icon-col field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items">
              <div class="field__item"><div class="paragraph paragraph--type-p-icon-column paragraph--view-mode-default">
  
  
<div  class="title-wrapper">
          
                          <h3  >
      View the Program (PDF)</h3>
      
  


  </div>

            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-icol-body field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><article data-embed-button="media_image" data-entity-embed-display="view_mode:media.wysiwyg_415" data-entity-embed-display-settings="internal:/media/9336 1" data-entity-type="media" data-entity-uuid="a2a8b769-f54e-4af6-bbf8-863c05699a5b" data-langcode="en" class="embedded-entity"><a href="/media/9336" target="_blank"><article class="media media--type-image media--view-mode-wysiwyg-415">
  
      
            <div class="field field--name-field-image field--type-image field--label-hidden field__item">  <img src="/sites/default/files/styles/415_wide/public/images/2023-05/Athletics-Hall-of-Fame-2023-Program-Flier.PNG?itok=mNQsOyVO" width="415" height="541" alt="2023 Athletic Hall of Fame Ceremony Program" typeof="foaf:Image" class="image-style-_15-wide" />


</div>
      
